  "description": "I was Eun-Ho Sun’s biggest fan… And I never should’ve let her meet my boyfriend. I thanked my lucky stars when this mysterious author granted me the only interview she’d ever given in her illustrious career. She shared intense, off-the-record secrets with me. I even thought we could be friends. At first, it seemed like an invitation to her home would solidify our friendship, but she wound up in bed with my boyfriend. Will the woman I once idolized actually steal away the love of my life?!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
